<!-- ═══════════════════════════════ ARCHETYPES ═══════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="archetypes">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-label">Player Archetypes</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Every player has a type. Know who you're signing.</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">Archetypes are derived from a player's 8-trait personality matrix and are visible before you consume them from the pool. Sign the wrong archetype for your dressing room chemistry and you'll feel it on the pitch.</p>

        <div class="archetype-grid">
            <div class="archetype-card gold">
                <div class="archetype-name">The Prospect</div>
                <p class="archetype-desc">Raw talent with sky-high potential. Handle carefully — push too hard and they crack.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="archetype-card red">
                <div class="archetype-name">The Maverick</div>
                <p class="archetype-desc">Driven by personal glory. Can light up a game or derail a dressing room — often both in the same week.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="archetype-card mint">
                <div class="archetype-name">The Iceman</div>
                <p class="archetype-desc">Cool under pressure with elite consistency. Quiet, professional, and invaluable in a promotion run.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="archetype-card muted">
                <div class="archetype-name">The Journeyman</div>
                <p class="archetype-desc">Experienced and adaptable. Won't set the world on fire but will never let you down either.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="archetype-card gold">
                <div class="archetype-name">The Leader</div>
                <p class="archetype-desc">High loyalty and natural authority. Mentors younger players and lifts the squad when morale dips.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="archetype-card mint">
                <div class="archetype-name">The Grinder</div>
                <p class="archetype-desc">Maximum determination, minimal flair. Does the unglamorous work week after week without complaint.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="archetype-card red">
                <div class="archetype-name">The Wildcard</div>
                <p class="archetype-desc">Unpredictable and ego-driven. Brilliant in flashes. A constant headache for the coaching staff.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="archetype-card muted">
                <div class="archetype-name">The Veteran</div>
                <p class="archetype-desc">Experience beyond their years. Slowing down, but their presence steadies the whole squad.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<hr class="divider">
